From 364a8847bb692072e05de2e5faae61c2ea70245b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@hatch.local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:17:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] feat(production): redesign production order dialog (M2)

Section 1: them Ngay giao (readonly, derived tu STOCK_DOCUMENTS.DOCUMENT_DATE
qua MATERIAL_ISSUE_DOCUMENT_ID) va Han hoan thanh (DatePicker, nhap khi con
nhap, luu vao PRODUCTION_ORDERS.DUE_DATE - migration 62); chuyen o Ghi chu len
section 1; mapping hien thi Hinh thuc: 'Xuong che tac' / 'Noi bo' (C1).
Section 2: them cot Tuoi vang (GoldTypeCode) va cot Ghi chu vao grid (C7);
khong co field Loai SP trong code hien tai nen khong can xoa (C3).
Section 4: chi giu Tien cong du kien tu tinh; khong ton tai field Hinh thuc
tinh cong / Thanh toan trong code (A5) nen khong can xoa.
Footer: them dai 3 o tong (TL giao chi | SL san pham | Tien cong VND).
Khoa phieu sau Xac nhan giao vang va cong tien cong vao cong no khi chot
da co san trong code - khong can sua.
